{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415673","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415673","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041567301:0":{"text":"오늘도 완벽한 폭파를 14번이나 성공했어!","source_cn":"今天又完成了十四次完美无缺的爆炸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10CA9D8472EB5444","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041567302:0":{"text":"멋져, 멋져! 저쪽에서도 너를 칭찬하고 있더라.","source_cn":"很棒很棒，我已经接到那边对你的称赞了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x557FA1085FCD0768","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041567303:0":{"text":"이번에는 어떤 기준으로 폭파할 곳을 정했지?","source_cn":"这次你炸点的选择是怎么想的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA87098E18043FC4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041567304:0":{"text":"어, 그냥 평소처럼? 그냥 느낌이지 뭐. 거기가 느낌이 좋더라고.","source_cn":"呃，就还是那样啊，就，光凭着感觉，感觉那里比较好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF222AEC5FAD4F997","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041567305:0":{"text":"아니아니, 그래도 예전에는 위력이 큰 곳을 고르지 않았어?","source_cn":"不不不，你以前选择炸点，是会选择威力比较大的位置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6857EDFF3AA70DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041567306:0":{"text":"핀포인트로 몇 군데를 폭파해서, 빠르게 넓은 공간을 파내려가는 것처럼 말이야.","source_cn":"比如用几个点，就可以迅速开凿出最大的空间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1309A04556ECFCBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041567307:0":{"text":"그런데 이번에는 광맥이랑 가장 가까운 곳을 골랐다고 들었는데?","source_cn":"但这次选择，我接到的汇报是，你选择了最接近矿脉的位置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x09487D1BB68F911D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041567308:0":{"text":"작업 반장 아저씨가 광맥이 깊은 곳에 박혀있어서 그 주변은 안전하다고 그랬거든!","source_cn":"因为那个带头的大叔说周围很安全，但矿脉很深。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3557CF445FE57F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041567309:0":{"text":"그래서 그 말만 믿고 터뜨린 거지. 중간에 뭔가 느낌이 이상해서 바꾸긴 했지만...","source_cn":"我是按照他提供的位置进行爆破的，但中途也不知道为什么就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80F34028F15BA868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041567310:0":{"text":"음, 아무래도 제대로 모르는 거 같은데.","source_cn":"唔，还是知其然不知其所以然啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x963141F988DD74AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041567311:0":{"text":"쿠루루, 책을 좀 읽어보는 건 어때? 기초 이론 공부라던가...","source_cn":"库露露，你有没有考虑过念念书？去学习些理论知识——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D997D2C8B60D868","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041567312:0":{"text":"요즘 악마들도 책을 많이 읽는다던데?","source_cn":"我可是听说了，许多恶魔也是深谙诗书的哦？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D65FB11E236A1C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041567313:0":{"text":"정말? 악마들도 공부를 한단 말야?","source_cn":"真的吗？厉害的恶魔也要学习吗……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC01B8DA0C21F583","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041567314:0":{"text":"아니, 안 속아! 그런 이상한 건 안 배울 거거든!","source_cn":"不对！我才不会上当！我才不会学那些乱七八糟的东西！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA83DAEFBCE360376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041567315:0":{"text":"오~ 점점 속이기 어렵네.","source_cn":"唔，越来越不好骗了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A3A4B1DB38AB8B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:库露露":{"text":"쿠루루","source":"库露露","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:祖娅":{"text":"조아","source":"祖娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":2}}